---
import { SITE, REPOSITORY } from '../lib/book.mjs';
const chapters = [
  ['Getting started', 'Installation, editor setup, and a first program.', '/book/getting-started/'],
  ['The language', 'Syntax, types, functions, and error handling.', '/book/language-basics/'],
  ['Domain modeling', 'Value objects, entities, and application boundaries.', '/book/ddd/'],
  ['Async and resources', 'Running work and managing its lifetime.', '/book/async/'],
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="Dovetail is an experimental programming language for business logic. Read the language book, try a first program, or explore the source." />
    <link rel="canonical" href={SITE} />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.png" type="image/png" sizes="128x128" />
    <link rel="describedby" href={`${SITE}/llms.txt`} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#131516" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <title>Dovetail — A language for business logic</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="shell">
      <header>
        <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Dovetail home"><img src="/dovetail-logo.png" width="40" height="40" alt="" />dovetail</a>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/book/">Book</a>
          <a href={REPOSITORY}>GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </nav>
      </header>
      <main id="main">
        <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="title">
          <p class="status">An experimental programming language</p>
          <h1 id="title">Dovetail</h1>
          <p class="description">A language for business logic.</p>
          <p class="overview">Dovetail has records, enums, newtypes, typed errors, and structured concurrency. Programs compile to WebAssembly.</p>
          <p class="development">The compiler and libraries are in early development.</p>
          <div class="reading">
            <a href="/book/getting-started/">Get started <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a href="/book/">Read the book</a>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="example" aria-labelledby="example-title">
          <div class="section-label"><h2 id="example-title">A small example</h2><span>Quantity.dove</span></div>
          <pre tabindex="0" aria-label="A validated Quantity type in Dovetail"><code><span class="keyword">newtype</span> <span class="type">Quantity</span> <span class="keyword">private</span> = <span class="type">Int32</span>

<span class="keyword">module</span> <span class="type">Quantity</span> =
    <span class="keyword">public function</span> make(value: <span class="type">Int32</span>)
        : <span class="type">Result</span>&lt;<span class="type">Quantity</span>, <span class="type">String</span>&gt; =
        <span class="keyword">if</span> value &gt; <span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">then</span>
            Ok(Quantity(value))
        <span class="keyword">else</span>
            Error(<span class="string">"Must be positive"</span>)</code></pre>
          <p>Here, construction is private. The <code>make</code> function checks the value and returns a typed result.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="installation" aria-labelledby="install-title">
          <h2 id="install-title">Try it</h2>
          <div class="install"><span aria-hidden="true">$</span><code>curl -fsSL https://dovetaillang.org/install.sh | sh</code><button id="copy" aria-label="Copy installation command">Copy</button></div>
          <span id="copy-status" class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></span>
          <p>For macOS and Linux. See the <a href="/book/getting-started/">getting started guide</a> for Windows and PATH setup.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="documentation" aria-labelledby="docs-title">
          <div class="section-label"><h2 id="docs-title">Documentation</h2><a href="/book/">All chapters <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
          <dl>
            {chapters.map(([title, description, href]) => <div><dt><a href={href}>{title}</a></dt><dd>{description}</dd></div>)}
          </dl>
          <p class="agent-note">For coding assistants, the same book is available as <a href="/llms.txt">Markdown</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </main>
      <footer><span>Dovetail</span><a href={REPOSITORY}>Source on GitHub</a><span>MIT / Apache 2.0</span></footer>
    </div>
    <script>
      const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#copy');
      button?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText('curl -fsSL https://dovetaillang.org/install.sh | sh');
          document.querySelector('#copy-status')!.textContent = 'Installation command copied.';
          button.textContent = 'Copied';
          setTimeout(() => { button.textContent = 'Copy'; }, 2000);
        } catch {
          document.querySelector('#copy-status')!.textContent = 'Select the command to copy it manually.';
        }
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { color-scheme: dark; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; background: #131516; color: #d5d9d8; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  :global(a) { color: #a8c5b5; text-underline-offset: 4px; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }
  :global(a:hover) { color: #d3e5da; }
  :global(:focus-visible) { outline: 2px solid #a8c5b5; outline-offset: 5px; }
  .shell { max-width: 828px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }
  header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; min-height: 88px; border-bottom: 1px solid #2b2e2f; }
  .wordmark { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: #e4e7e5; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.4px; text-decoration: none; }
  nav { display: flex; gap: 28px; font-size: 13px; }
  nav a { color: #a5adab; text-decoration: none; }
  .intro { padding-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 42px; }
  .status { color: #939c99; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 0 13px; }
  h1 { font-size: 42px; font-weight: 550; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -1.4px; margin: 0 0 17px; color: #edf0ee; }
  .description { font-size: 21px; color: #d5d9d8; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .overview { max-width: 610px; color: #a8b0ad; margin: 0; }
  .development { color: #939c99; font-size: 13px; margin: 12px 0 0; }
  .reading { display: flex; gap: 26px; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 550; color: #d5d9d8; margin: 0; }
  .section-label { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 13px; }
  .section-label > span { font: 12px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; color: #939c99; }
  .section-label > a { font-size: 12px; }
  pre { background: #181b1c; border: 1px solid #303536; border-radius: 5px; overflow-x: auto; padding: 24px; margin: 0; font: 13px/1.85 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; }
  .keyword { color: #b5b5d2; }.type { color: #abc8bd; }.number { color: #d0bc9d; }.string { color: #bec99e; }
  .example > p, .installation > p { font-size: 13px; color: #939c99; margin: 12px 0 0; }
  .example > p { max-width: 610px; }
  p code { color: #bac3bf; font-size: .95em; }
  .installation { padding-block: 35px; }
  .install { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; border: 1px solid #303536; border-radius: 5px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-top: 13px; background: #181b1c; }
  .install > span { color: #939c99; }
  .install code { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font: 13px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; }
  .install button { margin-left: auto; border: 1px solid #3f4744; border-radius: 3px; padding: 5px 10px; background: transparent; color: #bbc3bf; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; }
  .install button:hover { background: #272d2b; }
  .documentation { padding-block: 4px 35px; }
  dl { margin: 0; }
  dl > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 190px 1fr; gap: 20px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #2b2e2f; }
  dt { font-size: 14px; }dt a { text-decoration: none; }dt a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  dd { font-size: 13px; color: #939c99; margin: 0; }
  .agent-note { font-size: 13px; color: #939c99; margin: 23px 0 0; }
  footer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 24px; padding-block: 22px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #2b2e2f; color: #939c99; font-size: 12px; }
  footer > span:last-child { margin-left: auto; }footer a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .skip { position: absolute; top: -100px; }.skip:focus { top: 5px; background: #181b1c; padding: 10px; z-index: 1; }
  .sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(50%); }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .shell { padding-inline: 22px; }header { min-height: 72px; }nav { gap: 22px; }.intro { padding-top: 42px; }
    h1 { font-size: 36px; }.description { font-size: 19px; }pre { padding: 18px; font-size: 12px; }
    dl > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3px; padding-block: 12px; }
    .install { padding: 11px; gap: 8px; }.install code { font-size: 11px; }.install button { padding: 5px 7px; }
    footer > span:last-child { margin-left: 0; }
  }
</style>
